<title>ITALY: INA SpA H1 gross profit up 16.5 pct.</title>
<headline>INA SpA H1 gross profit up 16.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Parent gross profit	     421.5 vs   361.7</p>
<p>    Total premium income	  1,352.2 vs 1,261.1</p>
<p>Note: INA SpA said in a statement that given market conditions, it would be difficult to repeat the first half performance in the second half. Nonetheless the full year result would still mark an improvement over 1995.  </p>
<p>    Total investments	    33,277.3 vs 32,921.9 (end Dec)</p>
<p>    Total credits		   2,431.6 vs  1,871.6</p>
<p>    Liabilities vs third p'ties   964.7 vs  1,296.7</p>
<p>    Reinsurance risk		1,750.0 vs  1,000.0</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
